{
  "version": "0.9.17",
  "notes": "Add PC research, Skyrim and reviewer specialists for complex questions, with at most two extra passes, nominal time budgets, visible saved contribution labels and citation-retention safeguards. Keep ordinary replies and laptop fallback lightweight; preserve the original answer when helpers are unavailable, late or invalid. Reuse the current 8B worker by default, accept its actual 8.2B Ollama metadata, and select optional installed larger reviewers according to GPU memory. Reject incomplete or oversized revisions. Preserve user settings, chats and memories. After both installations update, restart the stronger PC once to load the new background worker endpoints.",
